      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "type": "title",
              "value": "🔵 Rules and reminder ✨\n\n"
            },
            {
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "Only hosts who successfully register before the deadline will be eligible to participate in Beans Dash starting from June 26th.\n\n✅ Daily Task Rebates\n• Registered hosts can complete up to 6 task levels per day, each offering increasing rebate percentages.\n• The highest level offers up to 40% rebate on beans received.\n• Completing all 6 levels in a single day can yield up to 19255 beans in daily rewards.\n• Rewards are limited and will be distributed on a first-come, first-served basis."
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🔍 Notes\n• Rewards reset daily and do not carry over.\n• Task levels are non-cumulative. For example, if you reach Lv.1 (2000 beans), you must then collect an additional 3500 beans to complete Lv.2, and so on.\n• Once the reward quota for a tier is full, even if you meet the task target, no reward will be granted, and no notification will be issued."
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⚠️ Kind Reminder\n• Only beans received from the following regions will be counted toward the task targets:\nUK, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, US, and Canada\n• This event is only open to hosts who have registered in advance and been confirmed by the platform."
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
